<translate>
==== AttachmentType ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Defines the attachment type, and therefore the {{ll|AttachmentsProvided|hotbar slot}} the item can be added to, along with the AttachedLocation group, as defined in <code>AttachedLocations.lua</code>. These attachment types are defined as <code>attachments</code> in <code>ISHotbarAttachDefinition.lua</code>.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
AttachmentType = Rifle,
</syntaxhighlight>

== Attachment type slots and items == <!--T:3-->

<!--T:4-->
The table below shows a list of attachment types, the hotbar slots it can be used in, and the items that use it.
</translate>
{{Autogenerated|section=true|reason=Any changes to this section will be overwritten automatically.|source=[https://github.com/Vaileasys/pz-wiki_parser pz-wiki_parser (GitHub)]|collapsed=true}}
